{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"code","value":"type ParsedHotkey = ParsedModifiers & \n  | {\n  code?: never;\n  key: LogicalKey | string & object;\n}\n  | {\n  code: string;\n  key?: never;\n};","lang":"ts"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Defined in: "},{"type":"link","href":"https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L156","children":[{"type":"text","value":"hotkey.types.ts:156"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"A parsed binding matches either a logical key or a physical code, never both.\nCheck "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"code !== undefined"},{"type":"text","value":" to narrow to a physical binding. Its logical\ncharacter is unknown without a keyboard event and is not stored in "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"key"},{"type":"text","value":"."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"example","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Example"}]},{"type":"code","value":"parseHotkey('Alt+S') // { key: 'S', alt: true, ... }\nparseHotkey('Alt+[KeyS]') // { code: 'KeyS', alt: true, ... } — no key property","lang":"ts"}],"headings":[{"id":"example","text":"Example","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\ntype ParsedHotkey = ParsedModifiers & \n  | {\n  code?: never;\n  key: LogicalKey | string & object;\n}\n  | {\n  code: string;\n  key?: never;\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [hotkey.types.ts:156](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L156)\n\nA parsed binding matches either a logical key or a physical code, never both.\nCheck `code !== undefined` to narrow to a physical binding. Its logical\ncharacter is unknown without a keyboard event and is not stored in `key`.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nparseHotkey('Alt+S') // { key: 'S', alt: true, ... }\nparseHotkey('Alt+[KeyS]') // { code: 'KeyS', alt: true, ... } — no key property\n```\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: ParsedHotkey\ntitle: ParsedHotkey\n---\n\n```ts\ntype ParsedHotkey = ParsedModifiers & \n  | {\n  code?: never;\n  key: LogicalKey | string & object;\n}\n  | {\n  code: string;\n  key?: never;\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [hotkey.types.ts:156](https://github.com/TanStack/hotkeys/blob/main/packages/hotkeys/src/hotkey.types.ts#L156)\n\nA parsed binding matches either a logical key or a physical code, never both.\nCheck `code !== undefined` to narrow to a physical binding. Its logical\ncharacter is unknown without a keyboard event and is not stored in `key`.\n\n## Example\n\n```ts\nparseHotkey('Alt+S') // { key: 'S', alt: true, ... }\nparseHotkey('Alt+[KeyS]') // { code: 'KeyS', alt: true, ... } — no key property\n```\n"}
